    "Blanks tax numbers, the IBAN and every amount in the interface — for screen sharing, or a look over your shoulder. The exported PDF, the spreadsheet and the printed invoice are unchanged. Shortcut: ⇧⌘H.": {
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zakrije davčne številke, IBAN in vse zneske v vmesniku — za deljenje zaslona ali pogled čez ramo. Izvožen PDF, preglednica in natisnjen račun ostanejo nespremenjeni. Bližnjica: ⇧⌘H."
          }
        }
      }
    },
